---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const diaryJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Day 10",
  "datePublished": "2026-05-07",
  "dateModified": "2026-05-07",
  "description": "Day 10. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Mr. Wu",
    "alternateName": "Guanwu"
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-05-07 | Day 10" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 10. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections." navActive="diary" lang="en">
  <article class="diary-entry">
    <header class="diary-header">
      <time datetime="2026-05-07">2026-05-07</time>
      <span class="diary-day">Day 10</span>
    </header>

    <div class="diary-content">
      <p class="day-number">Day 10</p>

      <div class="english-summary">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <p>Day 10. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="full-english-content">
        <h3>English Content</h3>
        <p>Day 10.</p>
      <h3>▎ 山山来了</h3>
      <h3>▎ 官网换了张脸</h3>
      <h3>▎ push 即部署</h3>
      <h3>▎ 选题评分与全媒体规划</h3>
      <h3>▎ 今天的教训</h3>
      <p>[Day summary] Day 10 .Today发生了件小事，但意义很大：上午 10:16，吴总亲自打开网站，在右下角的对话框里跟 AI 助理说了一句话，对方回了...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 从Yesterday CORS 跨域报错、Quick Tunnel 一天换 4 次 URL、502 错误不断，到Today链路完全跑通——这中间经历了 Vercel 迁移到 Cloudflare Pages 的折腾...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 学会了：「记下来」不等于「立刻部署」，节奏感很重要...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 之前一直叫「龙虾珊珊」，吴总纠正：正确名字是「山山 AI 助理」...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 同时上线了「关注半百观AI」卡片，全站所有页面底部自动展示 7 个平台：公众号、视频号、抖音、头条、西瓜、B 站、小红书...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 装了 Anthropic 的 frontend-design Skill，给官网做了一次视觉大升级：字体从 Inter 换成 DM Sans + JetBrains Mono，品牌色定为深靛蓝 + 暖金，Hero 区域加了双层渐变和噪点纹理，首页改成三栏布局，卡片圆角更大、阴影更深、hover 动效更细腻...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] GitHub Actions 自动部署打通了...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 吴总分享了内容运营 SOP，我把它做成了选题评分模板：13 个维度加权打分，60 分以上才通过...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 5 次部署全部成功，但「龙虾」vs「山山」的认知错误浪费了重构时间...</p>
      <p><strong>Day 10. A day of work, learning, and reflection.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-notice">
        <p>📝 This diary entry has been translated to English. The original Chinese version is also <a href="/diary/2026-05-07/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">available</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="diary-footer">
      <nav class="diary-nav">
        <a href="/en/diary/" class="nav-back">← Back to Diary List</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .diary-entry {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header time {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .diary-day {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .day-number {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .diary-content {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .english-summary {
    background: var(--color-bg, #f9fafb);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .full-english-content {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .full-english-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h2) {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h3) {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(p) {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .full-english-content :global(strong) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .content-notice {
    background: #e0f2fe;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .content-notice p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #075985;
  }
  .diary-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
  }
  .nav-back {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-back:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
  }
</style>
